  "gold_provenance": "Article numbers and headings read directly from chunks.heading in the production corpus; questions were written from those headings, not the reverse. Questions deliberately paraphrase the article's subject rather than restating its title, so the set does not simply reward the article-title branch. Every gold (act, article) pair was validated against the corpus before being added. Gold labels were then audited for ambiguity against the corpus: any item whose gold article shared its title with another article in the same act was either given both articles as acceptable, or replaced when the question was too generic to have a single answer.",
